# banshee-aen: the CPU who-line uses the recent-rate consumers when the census HAS them
# and falls back to the cumulative lens only when it does NOT. Flipping the emptiness
# guard makes a populated census fall back (naming the fleet total instead of the hot
# processes) and an empty one map to Some(empty) — the exact regression the fix undoes.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/who.rs
test: the_cpu_who_prefers_the_recent_rate_lens_over_cumulative
